\newlabel{tab:hpc}{{3}{9}{Per-step sort cost in a synthetic HPC simulation. \DeltaSort beats the full \texttt {std::sort} baseline by up to $7\times $ in the cold regime ($n=10^4$), but \ESM is faster than \DeltaSort in most cases. At $n=10^6$, \ESM beats \DeltaSort by $1.9\times $ even in the cold regime}{table.caption.27}{}}
